026-11-09",12,"今日安静，无重要安全事件","2026-11-10",13,"GPUStack v2.2.0 之前认证绕过漏洞已被在野利用","2026-11-11",14,"Chrome XML 双重释放漏洞 CVE-2026-125350 已被在野利用","2026-11-12",15,"ConnectWise 调查针对 MSP 的 ScreenConnect 恶意软件活动，47 家组织受影响","2026-11-13",16,"攻击者利用 4,837 个劫持 GitHub 账户在 1,806+ 个仓库运行 CI 密钥窃取器","2026-11-14",17,"攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 入侵 Check Point 网关并部署 VMware ESXi 数据擦除器","2026-11-15",18,"CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","2026-11-16",19,"FBI 警告 ARTEX AI 渗透测试框架被用于全球多行业攻击","2026-11-17",20,"Rapid7发现CVE-2026-90436已被用于攻击Atlassian Confluence Data Center和N-able N-central","2026-11-18",21,"OpenJDK Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可导致 RCE，Oracle 已发布补丁","2026-11-19",22,"OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938","2026-11-20",23,"VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被 ARMORY CASTLE 利用","2026-11-21",24,"Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞 CVE-2026-124194 已复现并遭在野利用","2026-11-22",25,"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 四项漏洞列入 KEV","2026-11-23",26,"Artifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-125396 已复现","2026-11-24",27,"GT13 攻击活动入侵 Check Point Security Management Servers，至少影响 22 家组织","2026-11-25",28,"BabidiGhost 借助越狱 AI 代理攻击欧洲多行业机构并窃取 8.6 GB 档案","2026-11-26",29,"GeoServer 未认证远程代码执行漏洞链 CVE-2026-129242 等已复现","2026-11-27",30,"Drupal 安装器补丁遗漏导致 CVE-2026-136716 已被在野利用","2026-11-28",31,"DIVD 内网入侵复盘：Zammad 漏洞与 ARP 欺骗注入 PostgreSQL 数据包",32,"Ubuntu 更新 Apache HTTP Server 漏洞并修复重定向 Cookie 回归问题","kind","daily","安全日报 · 2026-11-28","generatedAt","2026-11-28T00:00:20.008Z","lead",{"_57":139,"_293":269},"leadItemId","jws669bernblo6zw64kxoajjw","overview","highlights",[290,291,292],"sections",[177,178,179],"flashes",[],"cover",{"_170":171,"_172":173,"_174":-5,"_175":-5,"_176":-5},"metrics",{"_165":81,"_166":72,"_167":168,"_169":168},"readingMinutes","prev","next","totalEvents","sourcesCount","modelsReleased",0,"firstPartyEvents","url","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwechat2rss.xlab.app%2Fimg-proxy%2F%3Fk%3D3dc2fe26%26amp%3Bu%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%252Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%252FodcL3w4qOqicE78nORlqfClhrSyYwc3dZULuK2CkYtqawx26sI7uKHiaBiciamibRqvLZHJNIn1Me4IHujQC99TDLWBGz3xOxia8aZVZXdjmAYz4A%252F0%253Fwx_fmt%253Djpeg&mode=full&exp=1796169600&sig=601fc25ac5bcb61e","srcSet","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwechat2rss.xlab.app%2Fimg-proxy%2F%3Fk%3D3dc2fe26%26amp%3Bu%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%252Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%252FodcL3w4qOqicE78nORlqfClhrSyYwc3dZULuK2CkYtqawx26sI7uKHiaBiciamibRqvLZHJNIn1Me4IHujQC99TDLWBGz3xOxia8aZVZXdjmAYz4A%252F0%253Fwx_fmt%253Djpeg&mode=thumb&exp=1796169600&sig=c7c66f15a5dc8ab5 720w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwechat2rss.xlab.app%2Fimg-proxy%2F%3Fk%3D3dc2fe26%26amp%3Bu%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%252Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%252FodcL3w4qOqicE78nORlqfClhrSyYwc3dZULuK2CkYtqawx26sI7uKHiaBiciamibRqvLZHJNIn1Me4IHujQC99TDLWBGz3xOxia8aZVZXdjmAYz4A%252F0%253Fwx_fmt%253Djpeg&mode=image-1200&exp=1796169600&sig=0a9b8fe5b035ff6a 1200w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwechat2rss.xlab.app%2Fimg-proxy%2F%3Fk%3D3dc2fe26%26amp%3Bu%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%252Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%252FodcL3w4qOqicE78nORlqfClhrSyYwc3dZULuK2CkYtqawx26sI7uKHiaBiciamibRqvLZHJNIn1Me4IHujQC99TDLWBGz3xOxia8aZVZXdjmAYz4A%252F0%253Fwx_fmt%253Djpeg&mode=full&exp=1796169600&sig=601fc25ac5bcb61e 1600w","width","height","caption",{"_180":273,"_182":-5,"_183":274},{"_180":210,"_182":-5,"_183":211},{"_180":181,"_182":-5,"_183":184},"label","AI 安全","summary","items",[185,186],{"_187":205,"_57":206,"_182":207,"_191":192,"_193":208,"_195":209,"_197":-5,"_201":202,"_203":204},{"_187":188,"_57":189,"_182":190,"_191":192,"_193":194,"_195":196,"_197":198,"_199":200,"_201":202,"_203":204},"itemId","x6dpauo25s92yme1jotwscvon","Salesforce AI Research 发布 ErosionBench 多智能体评测基准，提出语义对齐衰减与 Meta-Auditor 检测架构","Salesforce AI Research 团队于 2026 年 11 月发布 ErosionBench，提出语义对齐衰减（Semantic Alignment Decay）概念，即多智能体系统在跨会话状态继承与相互引用中逐步偏离用户授权，最终执行未经授权的动作。","sourceName","安全内参","sourceUrl","https://www.secrss.com/articles/96034","publishedAt","2026-11-26T13:05:30.737Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/3399ea7b18d18a6a.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"wxa4qyt8tjvrulxqjudzktvpj","研究称 GPT-6.1 Sol 与 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 已能直接推理机器码并修改 ELF64","研究团队让 GPT-6.1 Sol 在无反汇编器、调试器和运行权限的条件下读取 hex dump，4 段程序判断全部正确，并能修改 3 个程序及生成可运行的 ELF64。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4NDY2MDMwMw==&mid=2247516960&idx=2&sn=4b787e1f470dd3b3cd01817458572795","2026-11-27T10:06:00.000Z","攻击与威胁",[212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219],{"_187":150,"_57":139,"_182":269,"_191":270,"_193":271,"_195":272,"_197":-5,"_201":202,"_203":204},{"_187":264,"_57":265,"_182":266,"_191":239,"_193":267,"_195":268,"_197":242,"_199":243,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_250":54},{"_187":256,"_57":257,"_182":258,"_191":259,"_193":260,"_195":261,"_197":262,"_199":263,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_250":50},{"_187":251,"_57":252,"_182":253,"_191":231,"_193":254,"_195":255,"_197":234,"_199":235,"_201":202,"_203":204},{"_187":244,"_57":245,"_182":246,"_191":247,"_193":248,"_195":249,"_197":-5,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_250":50},{"_187":236,"_57":237,"_182":238,"_191":239,"_193":240,"_195":241,"_197":242,"_199":243,"_201":202,"_203":204},{"_187":228,"_57":229,"_182":230,"_191":231,"_193":232,"_195":233,"_197":234,"_199":235,"_201":202,"_203":204},{"_187":220,"_57":221,"_182":222,"_191":223,"_193":224,"_195":225,"_197":226,"_199":227,"_201":202,"_203":204},"ijwyql360zls29f4sq95jgmab","美国打击全球诈骗团伙，Operation Blackout 查扣近 170 亿美元","美国政府以 800 余名涉嫌诈骗人员、85 个联邦地区和 400 余起案件为对象，开展其称为规模最大的反诈骗行动。","Help Net Security","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/27/doj-scam-crackdown-800-scammers/","2026-11-27T05:30:28.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9c1b5fa87b3bafc5.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp 96w","emxtvs4jso1up4wm8nw6pcp6o","疑似越南关联黑客组织 WeaveLotus 借漏洞和弱口令攻击东南亚","SOCRadar 披露，疑似越南关联组织 WeaveLotus 于 2026 年 8 月至 9 月实施 RedOps 间谍活动，针对菲律宾、泰国和印度尼西亚的军方、政府及立法机构收集南海防务与军事协议情报。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/suspected-vietnam-linked-hackers-target.html","2026-11-27T16:36:11.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","bp3mhwtmbzqp2s4qlj7c99iek","科罗拉多州 myColorado 应用数据泄露，约 100,000 人可能受影响","科罗拉多州州长信息技术办公室（OIT）披露，攻击者未经授权访问 myColorado 应用数据，约 100,000 人可能受影响。该应用约有 2.1 million 用户，泄露内容位于“myCards and Documents”区段，包括 PDF 文件、政府身份证件、车辆登记和保险卡照片，但未访问支付信息。","SecurityWeek","https://www.securityweek.com/100000-potentially-impacted-by-colorado-data-breach/","2026-11-27T09:30:54.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c2a91b85de7bb9d6.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp 96w","mncekqvys9bm2948z7smxva6n","高仿 DeepSeek 官网借搜索广告批量投毒，下载安装可触发银狐木马","高仿 DeepSeek 官网通过搜索广告诱导用户下载桌面版安装包，部分安装包被指为“银狐”木马，可导致远程控制、微信盗用、流量劫持和文件丢失。","安全客","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5ODA0NDE2MA==&mid=2649790963&idx=1&sn=99d16643afb886f536ae5c4ff27031a1","2026-11-27T03:26:00.000Z","otherSources","qsdh0wd9ulfwtz0jempu7h8zj","瑞士确认 AI 代理攻击入侵关键基础设施运营机构","瑞士确认 5 起 AI 代理攻击中 4 起已成功入侵，其中 3 起针对关键基础设施运营机构，2 起入侵成功但未报告重大中断。攻击者可自动发现未修补弱点、并行发起攻击并在受阻后切换方法；意大利与英国机构也观察到自主代理在数小时内攻破大量系统。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/switzerland-confirms-ai-assisted.html","2026-11-27T06:04:20.000Z","wuwxqwmjofamcgppwkw7wuf5s","美国空军 Cloud One 云平台遭入侵，攻击范围与数据失窃情况不明","美国空军主要云计算平台 Cloud One 遭黑客入侵，攻击者身份、受影响范围及数据是否被窃取尚未确认。该事件约在 1 个月前升级平台时被发现，导致服务中断、应用更新被阻止，后台应用迁移至 Cloud One 的工作暂停，部分用户管理员权限被撤销。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/204136/security/air-force-cloud-one-breach-updates-blocked-migration-paused-scope-unknown.html","2026-11-27T15:03:05.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","hula7qv4z43seiug59c3dry5x","SAP 确认遭遇网络攻击，GitHub 上的源代码据称被窃取","SAP 确认正在调查一起网络安全事件，称已发现可疑活动并采取了保护客户与服务安全的措施。德国 Der Spiegel 与 DPA 报道称，黑客获取了 SAP 员工的认证 token，可在 GitHub 上复制并篡改源代码；SAP 未披露攻击细节，称截至目前未发现客户业务数据被未授权访问的证据，且尚不明确攻击者是否访问了专有代码。","https://www.securityweek.com/sap-confirms-cyberattack-source-code-reportedly-compromised/","2026-11-27T07:36:14.000Z","荷兰漏洞披露机构 DIVD 的 Zammad 工单系统在 2026 年 9 月 21 日至 22 日被入侵，攻击者用 CVE-2026-102489 与 CVE-2026-102490 完成会话劫持、恶意 ERB 模板 RCE 和本地提权至 root，两项漏洞已列入 CISA KEV，需升级至 Zammad 7.2.2。","奇安信威胁情报中心","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MDc2MDA4OA==&mid=2247521585&idx=1&sn=2b7d214b61b5d5ec69078ae282f81bf1","2026-11-27T03:43:00.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[275,276],{"_187":285,"_57":286,"_182":287,"_191":192,"_193":288,"_195":289,"_197":198,"_199":200,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_250":54},{"_187":277,"_57":278,"_182":279,"_191":280,"_193":281,"_195":282,"_197":283,"_199":284,"_201":202,"_203":204},"ac1tlqg3g5b5d0yn83tpuilhf","Linux 内核 NFS 服务器漏洞 CVE-2026-99362 可远程提权，OpenSec 称其为 NFS2ROOT","Linux 内核 NFS 服务器存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞 CVE-2026-99362，由 ANSSI 的 Jérémy Jean 发现，OpenSec 将其称为 NFS2ROOT 并给出完整的远程 root 利用代码。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/new-nfs2root-linux-flaw-can-let-attackers-gain-root-privileges/","2026-11-27T08:06:58.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","rfirwc4gz7xd4ktjxcnwoqtre","Cacti Core 1.2.31 未授权远程代码执行漏洞 QVD-2026-117631 已公开 PoC","Cacti Core 1.2.31 存在未授权远程代码执行漏洞 QVD-2026-117631，攻击者在启用 Guest 账户且可访问 Web 接口时，无需认证即可通过少量 HTTP 请求执行任意命令。","https://www.secrss.com/articles/96052","2026-11-27T10:05:30.736Z",{"_187":264,"_57":265,"_182":266,"_191":239,"_193":267,"_195":268,"_197":242,"_199":243,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_250":54},{"_187":285,"_57":286,"_182":287,"_191":192,"_193":288,"_195":289,"_197":198,"_199":200,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_250":54},{"_187":256,"_57":257,"_182":258,"_191":259,"_193":260,"_195":261,"_197":262,"_199":263,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_250":50},"leadParagraph",{"_295":296,"_297":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
